      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "\u0026q\"The genesis of all things, and the terminus of all phenomena.\"§r\nThis is it. The absolute magnum opus of alchemical research. You have finally pierced the ultimate veil of Equivalent Exchange. You are no longer restricted by the physical forms of matter, nor do you need to rely on the slow, rudimentary processes of furnaces and crafting grids. You have built a bridge between the physical world and the boundless sea of pure energy.\n\nFunctionally, this block acts as your central EMC database and exchange hub. By placing an item with an EMC value into the table, you simultaneously convert it into stored energy and \"teach\" the Table how to create it. You can then freely spend your stored EMC to pull out an infinite amount of any item the Table has learned. It is the ultimate logistical tool, limited only by the depth of your energy reserves.",
